  "body": "MAINLINE-033 complete. Primary account uses the actual 028 joining bill; the retained 027 five-percent allowance is a separate comparison.\n\nAcross R=10,15,20,30,50 m, the six-shell-mode least set is gamma+Q. Required factors fall from 1.98718/1.83621 to 1.79862/1.63551, with no strength improvement. Minimum-usage payload is zero; full-endpoint SF1 payload at R50 is 89,422.443 kg. Literal handbook gamma=.20/Q=.33 has no radius under the model's ideal envelope.\n\nFull-endpoint pair crossings: gamma+Q 6.822342 m; Q+strength 16.281907 m on the crimp gamma=1 branch; gamma+strength 103.892276 m only outside published sheet gauge. No single suffices in the searched model.\n\nWith the 10 MPa scarf screen, all three at R10 still miss by 12.7995 kg; gamma+Q first passes at 10.350852 m and carries 41,318.067 kg at R50 full endpoints. Retaining the 027 allowance moves the Q+strength shell crossing to 40.470112 m.\n\nEvery mode, factor, budget and sensitivity is filed. Independent checks: 10,289/10,289 scalar comparisons, 381 geometries, 61/61 dense-search cases. Nine NFIs; material inputs QUESTIONABLE, outputs PROJECTION, installed-hull SF unknown. Brief says stop/file; no next job is named.",
